# postcss 8.4.31, pinned exactly by `next` (apps/web > next > postcss). Next.js uses it only at
# BUILD time to process the application's own CSS; the standalone server traces the package
# but never feeds it attacker-controlled CSS or source maps. Fix: upgrade `next` once it ships
# postcss >= 8.5.18, or add a pnpm override (`next>postcss`) after verifying the web build.
# Owner: web workstream. Review by expiry.
CVE-2026-45623 exp:2026-12-31
